  "content_text": "今日嘅重點表達：\n[Key expressions for today:]\n第一：kick off——即係開始或者啟動某樣嘢。\n[Number one: kick off — to initiate or start something.]\n例子：多謝你帶頭搞呢個復古計劃。\n[Example: Thanks for kicking off this retro initiative.]\n第二點：過度設計——令嘢變得無必要咁複雜。\n[Number two: over-engineer — to make something unnecessarily complex.]\n例子：讚下團隊，因為佢哋反對咗我過度設計嘅做法。\n[Example: Kudos to the team for pushing back on my over-engineered approach.]\n第三：硬停——一個絕對嘅截止日期，冇得延長。\n[Number three: hard stop — a firm deadline that cannot be extended.]\n例子：我喺晚上十一點設咗個硬性截止時間，用嚟做代碼審核。\n[Example: I am setting a hard stop at 11 PM for code reviews.]",
